    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-Create Payments Payments Capture-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Batch Payment Capture API enables clients to efficiently process multiple payment capture requests in a single operation. This endpoint allows users to submit a batch of payment capture transactions, streamlining the payment processing workflow for businesses. It is particularly useful for merchants and payment processors that need to handle large volumes of transactions at once. With this API, developers can automate payment captures and manage transaction statuses, thereby enhancing operational efficiency.",
